rofesional 64bit, OLP/OEM, licensed for Pusat Pelaporan dan Analisis Transaksi Keuangan 4 Layar maximal 14 inch, high-resolution display (Full HD or higher) 5 Memori Minimum RAM 32 GB (soldered) 6 Harddisk Minimum Storage 1 TB SSD NVMe PCIe Gen4 for System Boot, Applications & data processing performance 7 Security Hardware-level Trusted Platform Module (TPM) 8 Wireless & Networking - Onboard integrated 802.11 g,n,ac,ax - Onboard integrated Bluetooth wireless 9 I/O Minimal I/O Interface ports: - 2 x USB - 1 x Audio Line in-out - Internal HDMI Display Output - 1 RJ-45 Gigabit Ethernet 10 Misc - Onboard integrated 802.11 g,n,ac,ax - Onboard integrated Bluetooth wireless - Onboard integrated HD Camera with microphone - Onboard integrated Fingerprint Reader - Long Life cycle battery - Backlit keyboard - Cable lock for Kensington-type Security Slot - Notebook/Laptop Softcase - Mouse USB cable with Laser sensor 11 Power supply cords Indonesian Plug Type (no plug converter) 12 Garansi - 3/3/3 (part/labor/onsite) - Support and Services: PPATK is allowed to retain physical possession of a failed internal hard drive for ensure security of classified, proprietary, or sensitive data (Keep Drive). 13 support letter Indonesian principal and brochure are needed B Laptop Pegawai (Comercial/Business/ Enterprise platform-based systems (refers to the physical components of a computer system)) 1 Merek Brand should in the leader Quadrants of Gartner’s magic quadrant for Global Enterprise Desktops and Notebooks as of November 2014 or later 2 Prosesor Intel® Core™ i7, H series, minimum 12th generation 3 Operating System Genuine Windows 11® Profesional 64bit, OLP/OEM, licensed for Pusat Pelaporan dan Analisis Transaksi Keuangan 4 Layar maximal 14 inch, high-resolution display (Full HD or higher) 5 Memori Minimum RAM 16GB in slots installed (dual-channel) 6 Harddisk Minimum Storage 512 GB SSD NVMe PCIe Gen4 for System Boot, Applications & data processing performance 7 Security Hardware-level Trusted Platform Module (TPM) 8 Wireless & Networking - Onboard integrated 802.11 g,n,ac,ax - Onboard integrated Bluetooth wireless 9 I/O Minimal I/O Interface ports: - 2 x USB - 1 x Audio Line in-out - Internal HDMI Display Output - 1 RJ-45 Gigabit Ethernet 10 Misc - Onboard integrated 802.11 g,n,ac,ax - Onboard integrated Bluetooth wireless - Onboard integrated HD Camera with microphone - Onboard integrated Fingerprint Reader - Long Life cycle battery - Backlit keyboard - Cable lock for Kensington-type Security Slot - Notebook/Laptop Softcase - Mouse USB cable with Laser sensor 11 Power supply cords Indonesian Plug Type (no plug converter) 12 Garansi - 3/3/3 (part/labor/onsite) - Support and Services: PPATK is allowed to retain physical possession of a failed internal hard drive for ensure security of classified, proprietary, or sensitive data (Keep Drive). 13 support letter Indonesian principal and brochure are needed', 198000000, 'med', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2989385);
